REM Protects RESTORE from losing its line-break-free numeric, user-label and symbolic-label
REM targets, in upper, lower and mixed case, plus a bare RESTORE and a RESTORE sharing a line
REM with a label.
RESTORE 0
restore 1
ReStOrE 2
RESTORE mylabel
RESTORE
L1: RESTORE 3
mylabel: x = 1
RESTORE *RETRY
restore *retry
ReStOrE *ReTrY
